    "heading": "Level 2: Uncanny Metabolism",
    "lineStart": 3239,
    "lineEnd": 3243
  },
  "section": "3.139",
  "rulesText": "When you roll Initiative, you can regain all expended Focus Points. When you do so, roll your Martial Arts die, and regain a number of Hit Points equal to your Monk level plus the number rolled.\n\nOnce you use this feature, you can't use it again until you finish a Long Rest."
}
